# Project Conventions (automation-dashboard)

## Stack

- Static HTML/CSS/JS dashboard (GitHub Pages on `gh-pages`)
- Current UI: `index.html` + `assets/css/dashboard.v16.css` + `assets/js/app.v16.js`
- Data: `data/*.json`, `data/history/`, fetched by `scripts/fetch-summaries.py`
- CI: `.github/workflows/update-dashboard.yml` deploys Pages

## When changing the dashboard

1. Bump `BUILD_TAG` in `app.v16.js` when JS/CSS behavior changes (cache bust).
2. Keep Ask Dashboard rule-based only (no GenAI keys in the browser).
3. Match existing tab layout: Overview | Needs attention | Trends | AI impact | Suite details.
4. Prefer small, focused diffs; do not add backend unless explicitly requested.

